{"_meta":{"openai/fileParams":["cvFile"],"securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Use this only in the step-by-step path, when create_tailored_resume is unavailable or failed, to tailor a resume from the operationIds of import_resume and analyze_job_offer. For a new request to tailor a resume to a job post, use create_tailored_resume instead. Runs the same adapter as the Matchaa website (rewords the experience with the job post's vocabulary, never invents skills) and keeps a private draft PDF with a before/after report and source evidence. Prefer the operationIds returned by import_resume and analyze_job_offer; otherwise pass the attached PDF (cvFile) or the resume text, with the job post text. Pass the job post's language unless the user asked for another. If interrupted, call it again with exactly the same arguments to resume. Do not use for wording or design changes to a tailored resume; use update_resume or rewrite_resume_section.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"cvFile":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"download_url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"},"file_id":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"file_name":{"type":"string"},"mime_type":{"type":"string"}},"required":["download_url","file_id"],"type":"object"},"cvText":{"maxLength":80000,"minLength":20,"type":"string"},"guestToken":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":40,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","type":"string"},"language":{"default":"fr","enum":["fr","en"],"type":"string"},"offerOperationId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"offerText":{"maxLength":20000,"minLength":20,"type":"string"},"sourceOperationId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^